NC Digital provides local SEO services for businesses in Monmouth — helping you rank higher on Google when people across Monmouthshire and the Welsh Borders search for your services.

## Why local SEO matters for Monmouth businesses

Monmouth is a market town that draws customers from across Monmouthshire and the surrounding area. Local SEO makes your business visible at the exact moment someone is searching — whether that's "café Monmouth", "solicitor Monmouthshire", or any trade or service you provide.

## What's included in our local SEO service

- Local keyword research — the exact terms your customers search
- Google Business Profile optimisation
- On-page SEO — page titles, headings, meta descriptions, schema markup
- Local citation building and directory listings
- Content strategy to target local search terms
- Monthly reporting with keyword rankings and traffic data

